  ⚠ svelte(no-add-event-listener): Do not use `addEventListener`. Use the `on` function from `svelte/events` instead.
   ╭─[no_add_event_listener.tsx:2:2]
 1 │ <script>
 2 │     node.addEventListener('click', handler);
   ·     ───────────────────────────────────────
 3 │ </script>
   ╰────
  help: `import { on } from 'svelte/events'`, then `on(target, type, handler)`.

